          ],
          "value": "Consists of a ring of transmembrane domains, which shield a highly conserved extracellular structural funnel extending into the middle of the lipid bilayer (PubMed:30283133). The conserved catalytic His residue is located at the bottom of this funnel and is connected to the intracellular DltC through a narrow tunnel (PubMed:30283133)"
